# Golden run of Brakes.dll's КЛУБ-У on a six-car ЭД9М (G M P M MR GR),
# docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md step 3.2, with the ЭК (a track number):
# the train's data (6 wagons), track 1 right; a line with greens, a speed
# post down to 60 and back to 120 (the rising limit waits for the train),
# a yellow, a КЖ the train stops at, the red after it passed at under
# 20 km/h with the ВК, cleared; then a post down to 15 taken too fast with
# the РБ left alone: the ЭПК vents. The РБ (23) is pressed every 5 s till
# then. RTS's air.
#
# The ЭД9М's keys (AuxLibraryParameters): 401 И, 402 К, 403 Л (the train's
# data), 404 П (the track), 405 ВК, 406 МП, 408 ВВОД, 409 ПС, 410 СБ,
# 411 +, 412 −, 413 0, 416 1, 419 2, 422 3, 415 4, 418 5, 421 6, 414 7,
# 417 8, 420 9. The РБ 23, the ЭПК key 26, the 395 switch 2 (II 1, III 2,
# IV 3, V 5), the controller 0 (5 zero, 6 М, 7 the first notch), the
# reverser 1.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_ED9M-0060 mdd_ED9M-0060_G mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_P
#       mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_MR mdd_ED9M-0060_GR --script tests/data/golden/ed9m_klub.script
#       --record ed9m_klub.tsv
0    voltage 25000 50
0    line_limit 120
0    line_signal S1 600 7
0    line_post 900 60
0    line_post 1300 120
0    line_signal S2 1600 7
0    line_signal S3 2100 3
0    line_signal S4 2600 1
0    line_signal S5 3200 0
0    line_signal S6 4300 7
0    line_post 3600 15
1    switch 2 1
2    switch 35 1
# The train's data: Л, the driver's and the train's numbers and the axles
# as they are, 6 wagons, the mass as it is.
4    press 403 408 408 408 421 408 408
# The track: П 1 ВВОД, ПРИЗН. ПРАВ. 1 ВВОД.
8    press 404 416 408 416 408
10   screen 180 17 1ПР
10   screen 180 16 ЭК
# Off to about 40 km/h, then coasting.
20   switch 1 3
21   switch 0 5
23   switch 0 7
44   switch 0 5
# Kept at 30 .. 40 km/h.
0    when 1500 switch 0 7
0    when 1550 switch 0 5
# Under the КЖ's curve (0.08 km/h a metre to S4): V, lap, stopped some
# 350 m before it; II; creeping on to within 200 m of it, stopped there.
0    when 2150 switch 2 5
0    then 1.3 switch 2 2
0    then 18 switch 2 1
0    then 28 switch 0 7
0    then 36 switch 0 5
# Standing on КЖ within 200 m: the ВК gives 20 km/h (the КЖ's curve no
# more); on past the red at under 20. S5 cleared, off again to about
# 25 km/h: the post at 15 comes too fast and the ЭПК vents (the РБ does
# not answer over the permitted speed).
0    when 2420 switch 2 5
0    then 2 switch 2 2
0    then 14 expect speed < 0.5
0    then 14 expect bits8 & 0x80000
0    then 16 switch 2 1
0    then 18 press 405
0    then 20 screen 180 24 020
0    then 26 switch 0 7
0    then 34 switch 0 5
0    when 2700 line_aspect S5 7
0    when 2750 switch 0 7
0    when 2850 switch 0 5
0    when 3400 expect speed > 20
0    then 30 expect var24 == 45
0    then 30 expect pipe < 1
# The РБ every 5 s.
25  press 23
30  press 23
35  press 23
40  press 23
45  press 23
50  press 23
55  press 23
60  press 23
65  press 23
70  press 23
75  press 23
80  press 23
85  press 23
90  press 23
